  "slug": "line-startup-change-request-form",
  "title": "Line Startup Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Compare current and proposed line startup controls, assess affected work, predefine evidence, authorize a transition boundary, implement, and verify results.",
  "description": "A controlled line startup change request form for changing the production line clearance, setup, and controlled release without losing revision traceability, impact ownership, pre-implementation evidence, transition control, rollback readiness, post-change verification, or receiving handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use before altering the work order, setup instruction, approved recipe or program, and site safety procedure or its execution when the proposed state must be assessed, approved, introduced at a clear effective boundary, and verified before closeout.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
